  <!-- A FLOODED SUPERDEEP cell. Same reasoning as RM_Fill_Water_Superdeep:
       the temp layer wins in TerrainAt and a flooded superdeep cell must
       keep reading as superdeep — but PASSABLE, matching RM_Channel_Superdeep
       and RM_Fill_Water_Superdeep. Ruling 26 ("SUPERDEEP captures as if dry")
       requires dry and flooded superdeep to share passability, or the fill
       would silently become the barrier the ruling says it is not. -->
